---
const title = "Linux";
---

<html lang="zh-CN">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
        <title>{title}</title>
        <meta
            name="description"
            content="Linux 技术学习与实践笔记"
        />
    </head>

    <body>
        <header class="site-header">
            <nav class="nav container">
                <a href="/" class="brand">Boke</a>
                <div class="nav-links">
                    <a href="/Technology">技术</a>
                    <a href="/Technology/linux">Linux</a>
                    <a href="/about">关于</a>
                </div>
            </nav>
        </header>

        <main class="container page">
            <section class="hero">
                <p class="eyebrow">Technology</p>
                <h1>{title}</h1>
                <p class="subtitle">
                    Linux 是开源操作系统的核心基础，适合开发、运维和服务器部署。
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="content-grid">
                <article class="card">
                    <h2>基础概念</h2>
                    <p>
                        Linux 以内核为核心，结合 shell、文件系统和用户权限机制，构成稳定可靠的
                        计算环境。
                    </p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>文件系统结构</li>
                        <li>权限管理</li>
                        <li>进程与服务</li>
                        <li>包管理器</li>
                    </ul>
                </article>

                <aside class="card sidebar">
                    <h3>快速导航</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li><a href="#install">安装</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#command">常用命令</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#server">服务管理</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#network">网络配置</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </aside>
            </section>

            <section class="info-section" id="install">
                <h2>安装与环境</h2>
                <p>
                    可以选择 Ubuntu、Debian、CentOS、Arch 等发行版，根据实际需求配置开发环境
                    或服务器环境。
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="info-section" id="command">
                <h2>常用命令</h2>
                <pre><code>ls -la
cd /var/www
pwd
sudo apt update
sudo apt install nginx</code></pre>
            </section>

            <section class="info-section" id="server">
                <h2>服务管理</h2>
                <p>
                    Linux 常见的服务管理包括 systemctl、service、journalctl 等命令，
                    能够灵活查看和控制系统服务状态。
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="info-section" id="network">
                <h2>网络配置</h2>
                <p>
                    网络配置通常涉及 IP 地址、网关、DNS、端口开放和防火墙策略，适合弹性部署
                    与安全加固场景。
                </p>
            </section>
        </main>

        <footer class="site-footer">
            <div class="container">
                <p>© 2026 Boke</p>
            </div>
        </footer>
    </body>
</html>

<style is:global>
    :root {
        --bg: #0f172a;
        --bg-soft: #111827;
        --panel: #ffffff;
        --panel-alt: #f8fafc;
        --text: #1f2937;
        --muted: #6b7280;
        --primary: #2563eb;
        --primary-dark: #1d4ed8;
        --border: #e5e7eb;
        --shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
    }

    * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f8fafc 0%, #eef2ff 100%);
        color: var(--text);
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    a {
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: none;
    }

    .container {
        width: min(1100px, calc(100% - 2rem));
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .site-header {
        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.96);
        color: #fff;
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 10;
        backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    }

    .nav {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        min-height: 72px;
    }

    .brand {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        gap: 1.25rem;
        align-items: center;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .nav-links a {
        color: #dbeafe;
        transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
        color: #ffffff;
    }

    .page {
        padding: 3rem 0 5rem;
    }

    .hero {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a, #1d4ed8);
        color: white;
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 3rem 2rem;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .eyebrow {
        margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        opacity: 0.8;
    }

    .hero h1 {
        margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
        line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .subtitle {
        margin: 0;
        max-width: 680px;
        font-size: 1.08rem;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
    }

    .content-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(260px, 1fr);
        gap: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .card {
        background: var(--panel);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 18px;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .card h2,
    .card h3 {
        margin-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .card ul {
        margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
        padding-left: 1.2rem;
        color: var(--muted);
    }

    .sidebar ul {
        list-style: none;
        padding-left: 0;
    }

    .sidebar li {
        margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }

    .sidebar a {
        color: var(--primary);
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    .info-section {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 18px;
        padding: 1.5rem 1.5rem 1.2rem;
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .info-section h2 {
        margin-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .info-section p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
    }

    pre {
        margin: 0;
        background: #0f172a;
        color: #e2e8f0;
        padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow-x: auto;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .site-footer {
        background: #0f172a;
        color: #cbd5e1;
        padding: 1.2rem 0;
        text-align: center;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .content-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .nav {
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 0.8rem 0;
            gap: 0.7rem;
        }

        .nav-links {
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .hero {
            padding: 2rem 1.25rem;
        }
    }
</style>